 |  |  |  | $-1$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+2z=5 \\\\ 2x+6y+5z=22 \\\\ x-2y-3z=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 22 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 6 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 22 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186284626 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "79a208fd-896a-5c77-9393-c375ef3c85f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284628} {:answer/id #uuid "9dcae36b-dda8-54da-a399-069dd6c76bb5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284629}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9dcae36b-dda8-54da-a399-069dd6c76bb5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284629} :answer-field/id #uuid "56ed2887-9165-5706-9184-ba7da9f01c75" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284627} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f0640116-bd36-54c0-af93-6a26232c4f65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284631}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f0640116-bd36-54c0-af93-6a26232