 $4$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x-y+z=0 \\\\ 5x+y-7z=-2 \\\\ -2x+4y+3z=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 1 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 1 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186284636 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e95b0c43-bafa-5ff5-a880-447b32e634c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284638}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e95b0c43-bafa-5ff5-a880-447b32e634c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284638} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ac48ae7-4479-51d2-916a-e79a58946003" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284637} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "81dc5e60-b86e-567f-ba1e-0d96f2d3ef7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284640}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "81dc5e60-b86e-567f-ba1e-0d96f2d3ef7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284640} :answer-field/id #uuid "afcb27c1-0eca-517b-afca-d211f30d5f31" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284639} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71058fae-5353-569f-a269-e76ad80d1c56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284642}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71058fae-5353-569f-a269-e76ad80d1c56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284642} :answer-field/id #uuid "96355541-dcd3-5aad-8053-ad0ec981af86" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284641} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "871c97a9-86d4-570e-b098-5a2c7414ac62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284644}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "871c97a9-86d4-570e-b098-5a2c7414ac62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284644} :answer-field/id #uuid "970c6af4-7012-57f7-86e2-84c2f843dfa9" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284643}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "421e7558-4703-5886-9be1-9f3cc9f19aeb" :question/math-academy-id "q-316983" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+z=1 \\\\ 3x-y+4z=8 \\\\ -4x+y+5z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $1$ | {{field-1}} | $1$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $1$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $3$ | $-1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $8$ |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} | $1$ | $5$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+z=1 \\\\ 3x-y+4z=8 \\\\ -4x+y+5z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186284645 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f87dd92a-95f5-5bc1-ac33-1c9ab1aa25c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284647} {:answer/id #uuid "f05b4508-334e-5647-ac52-1c34d77ffe58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284648}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f05b4508-334e-5647-ac52-1c34d77ffe58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284648} :answer-field/id #uuid "cdf780d9-b415-5718-ad58-68c1088122c8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284646} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a9437d0b-b101-59cd-a076-a9d6a69a5f90" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284650}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9437d0b-b101-59cd-a076-a9d6a69a5f90" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284650} :answer-field/id #uuid "b22341ac-f523-5fc6-a2fa-17463c32970f" :answer-field/key 