=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -8\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186284655 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bbe1269f-195b-5f62-b6b1-36a8b0482cbd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284657}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bbe1269f-195b-5f62-b6b1-36a8b0482cbd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284657} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f3c74d2-eed2-5ea4-8c96-61cf205dfcb1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284656} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f47dfde3-f646-5d17-96be-388014385f99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284659}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f47dfde3-f646-5d17-96be-388014385f99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284659} :answer-field/id #uuid "46e7d0e4-2ac6-5255-b81d-cd160b07ec81" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284658} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a31fd5b-3ddc-5f81-b9a5-c